    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is proud to present 90 Kiltipper Gate. A superb own-door, ground floor apartment offering comfort, space, and excellent outdoor features in a much sought-after development. No onward chain!\n\nThis spacious two-bedroom apartment enjoys its own private entrance and boasts a rare combination of a private front lawn area and rear patio, ideal for those seeking both privacy and practicality. \n\nInside, the apartment has been well maintained throughout and is thoughtfully laid out with a bright, open-plan living and dining area. The kitchen is tucked neatly to one end of the room and has been upgraded with high-quality kitchen units and modern countertops, making excellent use of the space. \n\nThe main bedroom is a generous double with built-in wardrobes and an upgraded ensuite bathroom finished to a high standard. A second double bedroom, and an upgraded main bathroom complete the accommodation. The property also benefits from a large utility/storage room along with multiple additional storage spaces throughout. The property benefits from GFCH, DG windows and boasts a C BER rating.\n\nOutside, the private front and rear patios are perfect for enjoying sunny days, entertaining, or simply relaxing. \n\nLocated within easy reach of local shops, schools, and sporting facilities, the property also benefits from quick access to the M50, making it an ideal choice for commuters."
      },
      {
